[32m+[m[32m## H-10 — Limits, retries and retention[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStatus: PARTIALLY RESOLVED[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDecisions:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- All form fields must have explicit server-side maximum lengths.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The request payload must have an explicit maximum size.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The browser must not perform automatic submission retries.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Each submission must receive a unique `submission_id`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Retries of the same submission must reuse the same `submission_id`.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Backend processing must be idempotent.[m
[32m+[m[32m- The same `submission_id` must never create multiple leads.[m
[32m+[m[32m- QA data must use short-lived/test retention.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Production retention remains unresolved until the privacy policy and operational retention policy are approved.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mOpen:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Final production retention period.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Final operational retention policy.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
