[32m+[m[32m1. `validation_error`[m
[32m+[m[32m2. `recoverable_error`[m
[32m+[m[32m3. `unconfirmed_reception`[m
[32m+[m[32m4. `confirmed_success`[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA timeout must NOT automatically be treated as definitive submission failure.[m
[32m+[m
