[32m+[m[32m## H-14 — Operational history[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStatus: RESOLVED[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mStore only the minimum operational history required to diagnose lead processing.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAllowed operational fields:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- `submission_id`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `lead_id`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `status`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `created_at`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `updated_at`[m
[32m+[m[32m- `attempt_number`[m
[32m+[m[32m- processing timestamps[m
[32m+[m[32m- provider/result code when applicable[m
[32m+[m[32m- sanitized error code[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mRules:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- Do not duplicate form PII in operational logs.[m
[32m+[m[32m- Do not log form field values unnecessarily.[m
